    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T08:30:27Z",
    "body": "The motion code did not change in this window. The merges between the last green tip (11402dba4, run 44879723449 green) and this red tip (8be100737) are #3104 (post crate + goldens + .gitattributes) and #3031 (MCP/agent reference). Neither changed a file under crates/motion - checked both file lists.\n\nThe same test binary passed on the green tip in 64 s. It failed here in 145 s, and the run flagged its two tests as slow. That points at a wall-time-sensitive failure on a loaded runner, not a code break.\n\nFirst steps for the worker: rerun the step once (cargo xtask gate batch --only \"motion suites: adaptive_troch_parallel\" on current main, or wait for the next post-merge run). If it is green, this is a flake: find the time or budget assumption in wide_rectangular_pocket_is_cleared_by_parallel_lanes and pin or remove it (the slow lane note per AGENTS.md \"Test the change, not everything\").\n",
