    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T08:36:32Z",
    "body": "Looks already fixed on upstream/main 8be100737: cargo xtask gate batch --only \"motion suites: adaptive_troch_parallel\" passes without a change. Suggest closing; the maintainer decides.\n\nBoth wide_rectangular_pocket_is_cleared_by_parallel_lanes and corner_cleanup_reduces_34x16_rest_to_at_most_hsm_rest passed in 36.09 seconds. The selected gate exited 0.\n\nThe 90-second assertion is still present. This result is consistent with a runner-load flake, not proof that the timing risk is fixed. Commit c8a625d58 introduced the assertion for #2990; I found no later fixing commit for this file.\n\nStopped under the requested non-reproduction rule. No source or test changes. Claim released.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
